<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #111827;">
  <h2 style="color:#ea580c;">Update on Your Consultation Request</h2>

  <p>Dear {{citizenName}},</p>

  <p>
    We wanted to let you know that
    <strong>{{lawyerName}}</strong>
    has reviewed your consultation request on
    <strong>LawRoute</strong>
    but is unable to take it forward at this time.
  </p>

  <p>
    You can log in to LawRoute to review your options, submit a new request, or
    look for another lawyer who may be able to assist.
  </p>

  <p>
    <a
      href="{{loginUrl}}"
      style="display:inline-block;padding:8px 14px;background:#ea580c;color:white;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;"
    >Review on LawRoute</a>
  </p>

  <p style="color:#6b7280;margin-top:18px;">Thanks,<br />The LawRoute Team</p>

  <hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #e6e6e6;margin:18px 0;" />

  <p style="color:#9ca3af;font-size:12px;">©
    {{currentYear}}
    LawRoute. All rights reserved.</p>
</div>